# header p. 144, armor and weapon tables p. 63 and 65
Rules/Field/category: Category
Rules/Field/rarity: Rarity
Rules/Field/cursed: Cursed
Rules/Field/attunement: Attunement
Rules/Field/classes: Classes
Rules/Field/classes/attunement: Attunement by
