Rules/Field/spell-attack-bonus: Spell attack bonus
Rules/Field/spell-dc-bonus: Spell save DC bonus
Rules/Field/saving-throw-bonus: Saving throw bonus
Rules/Field/resistances: Damage Resistances
Rules/Field/resistances/grants: Grants resistance
Rules/Field/immunities: Damage Immunities
