Rules/Field/expertise: Expertise
Rules/Field/senses: Senses
Rules/Field/languages: Languages
Rules/Field/carrying-capacity: Carrying capacity
Rules/Field/height: Height

# Header lines: item p. 207 "Wondrous item, rare (requires attunement)"; spell p. 144 "3rd-level
# evocation", p. 134 "1st-level divination (ritual)", p. 144 "Evocation cantrip"; creature p. 393
# "Medium beast, unaligned", p. 395 "Medium humanoid (any race), any alignment", p. 389 "Medium
# swarm of Tiny beasts, unaligned"
Rules/Summary/Item: $category${, $rarity$}{ $attunement.flag$}{ $cursed.flag$}
Rules/Summary/Attunement: (requires attunement)
Rules/Summary/Cursed: (cursed)
Rules/Summary/Spell: $level.ordinal$-level $school${ $ritual.flag$}
Rules/Summary/Cantrip: $school$ cantrip
Rules/Summary/Ritual: (ritual)
Rules/Summary/Creature: $size$ $creature-type${ ($subtype$)}{, $alignment.name$}
Rules/Summary/Swarm: $size$ swarm of $swarm$ $creature-type.plural${, $alignment.name$}
Rules/Ordinal/1: 1st
Rules/Ordinal/2: 2nd
Rules/Ordinal/3: 3rd
Rules/Ordinal/4: 4th
Rules/Ordinal/5: 5th
Rules/Ordinal/6: 6th
Rules/Ordinal/7: 7th
Rules/Ordinal/8: 8th
Rules/Ordinal/9: 9th

# Lines that join fields: p. 65 "Versatile (1d10)", p. 63 "11 + Dex modifier (max 2)", p. 166
# "Concentration, up to 1 minute", p. 261 "Challenge 10 (5,900 XP)", p. 210 Bag of Holding "500
# pounds, not exceeding a volume of 64 cubic feet"
Rules/Line/damage: $damage${, versatile ($damage-versatile$)}
Rules/Line/ac: $ac${ + $ac-dex.flag$}{ (max $ac-dex-max$)}
Rules/Line/AcDex: Dex modifier
Rules/Line/charges: $charges${, regains $recharge$}{ (recharge: $recharge-on$)}
Rules/Line/save: $save.save${ DC $save-dc$}{, $save-success$ on a success}
Rules/Line/area: $area${ $area-shape$}
Rules/Line/duration: {$concentration.flag$ }$duration$
Rules/Line/Concentration: Concentration, up to
Rules/Line/ability: $ability.name${ $ability-score$}{ (max $ability-max$)}
Rules/Line/light: $light-bright$ bright{, $light-dim$ dim beyond}
Rules/Line/capacity: $capacity${, at most $capacity-volume$}
Rules/Line/casting: $casting-time${, $casting-trigger$}
Rules/Line/challenge: $cr${ ($xp$ XP)}
